- Replace `https://http-inputs-your-splunk-instance.splunkcloud.com:8088` with your actual Splunk HEC endpoint.
- Replace `your-splunk-hec-token` with your actual Splunk HEC token.
- Replace `arn:aws:s3:::your-s3-bucket-name` with the ARN of your S3 bucket for backup.

