- The `local-exec` provisioners are used to update the `kubectl` configuration when the EKS cluster is created and to remove the context when the cluster is destroyed.
- Ensure that the AWS CLI and `kubectl` are installed and configured on the machine where you run Terraform.
- The region in the provider block can be changed to any region that supports EKS.

