}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy_attachment" "s3_object_lock_policy_attach" {
  policy_arn = aws_iam_policy.s3_object_lock_policy.arn
  role       = aws_iam_role.s3_object_lock_role.name
}
```

This configuration ensures that the S3 bucket `mybucket` has versioning enabled and object lock retention set to 5 days in compliance mode. The IAM role and policy are configured to allow S3 to enforce these settings. All resources and variables are fully specified, and the configuration is deployable with Terraform version `~> 1.9.8` and the AWS provider version `~> 5.75`.

