The Terraform program will create an AWS S3 bucket to store the output of AWS CodeBuild projects. It will also set up an AWS CodeBuild project configured to use the S3 bucket for storing its build artifacts. The CodeBuild environment will be set up with a small compute type, using an Alpine Linux container image. The source for the builds will be configured to clone from a GitHub repository with a specified location.

