  }

  vpc_subnet_ids         = aws_subnet.public[*].id
  vpc_security_group_ids = [aws_security_group.proxy.id]

  tags = {
    Name = "aurora-proxy"
  }
}
```

This configuration sets up the necessary AWS resources to create an Aurora MySQL cluster with a proxy, including VPC, subnets, security groups, IAM roles, and Secrets Manager for secure credential storage. Ensure to adjust the `cidr_blocks`, `db_password`, and other parameters as needed for your specific environment and security requirements.

