1. **Create an S3 Glacier Vault**: This is where the archived data will be stored.
2. **Set up an SNS Topic**: This will be used to send notifications about events related to the Glacier vault.
3. **Create an IAM Role and Policy**: The role will allow Glacier to publish messages to the SNS topic.
4. **Configure the Glacier Vault Notification**: Link the Glacier vault to the SNS topic using the IAM role.

Below is the complete Terraform HCL configuration to achieve this:

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"  # You can change this to your preferred region
}

