This configuration sets up a VPC and a NACL with customizable ingress and egress rules. The default ingress rules allow SSH (port 22) and HTTP (port 80) traffic from any IP address, while the default egress rule allows all outbound traffic. You can modify the `nacl_ingress_rules` and `nacl_egress_rules` variables to customize the rules according to your needs.
